Package: streamline-kiosk
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Streamline Media OS <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/L3p3rkan/Streamline-Media-OS
Depends: python3, python3-evdev, network-manager, firefox | firefox-esr, gnome-control-center | network-manager-gnome
Description: streaming-service kiosk launcher for Ubuntu Desktop
 Streamline provides a full-screen dashboard for opening official streaming
 service websites in Firefox. It installs a local kiosk helper and starts
 Streamline automatically when a desktop user signs in.
